# Keep the build context free of VCS metadata (actions/checkout stores a GITHUB_TOKEN in
# .git/config), local tooling and build output. `.env` is intentionally not excluded: the
# documented Docker workflow copies .env.example to .env before building.
.git
.github
.idea
.DS_Store
.venv
venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache
**/node_modules
vite/dist
docs/_build
storage/uploads
